{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c4bfe83723c351bb14a0acda1b12b240438bebfd475c6d46149297844a2d2779", "ja": "モテモテプロデューサー！？", "zh": "大受欢迎的制作人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8526de02d60a45afa9524c2a2760c634da7b4ddd5d814ce42b1aeabee7b0ff8b", "ja": "レッスン中、ダンス勝負で麗花に挑む瑞希。\nプロデューサーの判定は……引き分け。その\n後、直接アドバイスを貰ったふたりを見て、\n他のメンバーもダンスを見てほしいと殺到す\nる。頑張れ、プロデューサー！", "zh": "练习中，瑞希在舞蹈对决中向丽花发起挑战。  \n制作人的判定是……平局。之后，其他成员看到  \n两人直接得到了建议，也纷纷围过来请求指点舞蹈。  \n加油，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "100cafeb41034e47530d093ac3eb6f7e560ff0c2f887cf75254ad83e3304d491", "ja": "（ツアーに向けて準備が進んでいる。\n今日は仕事の合間に、レッスンの見学中だ）", "zh": "（巡演的准备正在推进。今天正在工作间隙旁观训练）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "c09a8fce5017e2e260c6ca6d4cbeee7d69e0dca3175d280d14494a72a5a1249a", "ja": "くるっと回って～……はいっ、ポーズ！\n振りは大きく、キレのある動きで。", "zh": "转个圈～……好，摆个姿势！\n动作幅度要大，要干净利落。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "0097d9c7faefb933c51cc898b2c28a4633a6485155ab8756dfbef4d841e88495", "ja": "ありゃあ～、なかなか難しいねぇ……でも、\n負けないよぉ。麗花さん、もう一回お願いします。", "zh": "哎呀～还挺难的呢……不过，\n我可不会认输哦。丽花小姐，请再来一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "3722eda4c76ddbc4f89838be2dfc4680781df1a5c8d31793e404c84619fc98ec", "ja": "木下さん、燃えていますね。\nかくいう私も……めらめら。", "zh": "木下小姐，您干劲十足呢。\n其实我也是……熊熊燃烧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "9cc83592eaecb7c93fcd59ae5d0a2823478e030466b0cf06fa8be3927afb67cf", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……私も、もっとダンスのキレを\nよくしたいなぁ。どうすればいいんだろう……？", "zh": "呼、呼……我也想让舞蹈动作更加利落。要怎么做才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "ba1cda82db82f56007a3c3310f1741536f3c0eaa1e0d904c33847f0505c8982b", "ja": "百合子ちゃん。鏡をよく見て、チェックしてみて。\nダンスを美しく見せるには、客観性が大事よ。", "zh": "百合子。好好照照镜子，检查一下吧。\n要让舞蹈看起来更优美，客观性很重要哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "3d5eed26153a5251ff23bcce57fcf9a14a85826c0454285ff0b8d12e92546bf4", "ja": "客観性……なるほど、三人称視点ですね！\nありがとうございます、あずささん。やってみます！", "zh": "客观性……原来如此，就是第三人称视角吧！\n谢谢你，梓小姐。我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2d4d371368e38cff87e79192cb4d6182d4055af7658bf765c0e76293f058ee6a", "ja": "（うん……みんな、頑張ってるな！　えらいぞ！）", "zh": "（嗯……大家都在努力啊！真棒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "3768156e1af8dd957706f23bf301b0311435eb36691986841f4d9d3c667e8730", "ja": "はっ。{$P$}の、温かい視線……。\nもっと熱くなれというメッセージ……受け取ったぞ。", "zh": "啊。{$P$}那温暖的目光……  \n是让我更加热情起来的信息……我收到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "1edf3eb5599eb26a887ce0e3c36b0d25b2e9203a6d2f681aec1e7d32dc3ab8c6", "ja": "北上さん、ここはひとつ、ダンス対決をしませんか？\n審査員は{$P$}で。", "zh": "北上小姐，要不要来一场舞蹈对决？\n就让{$P$}来当评委吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "a9b18b000a0dd403b553bbfd55a098b2e1623b087a6b2e46439912059b029129", "ja": "わーい、楽しそう！　負っけないぞ～♪\n{$P$}さん、見ててくださいね。", "zh": "哇——听起来好有趣！我可不会输哦～♪\n{$P$}先生，请好好看着哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6cf155a0a5354854c5142508ccbfa0c62dcf4da5c379ab5d58c2bd110a973544", "ja": "えっ、どうしてそうなったんだ……？\nまあ、わかった。", "zh": "咦，怎么会变成这样……？\n嗯，好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "1214848d57d35815a3db4181e37a8e32607c7ceae63a1ee91888ab0ddb55f80c", "ja": "あらあら、なんだか盛り上がってきたわね。\nどっちも頑張って～！　うふふ。", "zh": "哎呀呀，气氛好像越来越热烈了呢。\n你们两个都加油～！呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "73dc4329311a7fef481faeff863e2f8ebae4eacf6e2b0cf5f66d1ae027b80167", "ja": "あー、楽しかった♪　瑞希ちゃんのおかげで、\n私もノリノリになっちゃった。肺活量、全開です！", "zh": "啊～，好开心♪多亏了瑞希，\n我也完全嗨起来了。肺活量，全开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "118dec0d0a39f9a5233e40b3a9cc81a962fded44e0f0e054d75953b72fb67118", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……どうにか、食らいつきました。\nお互いの健闘を称えたいところですが、その前に……。", "zh": "呼、呼……总算是勉强跟上了。\n虽然想称赞彼此的奋勇表现，但在那之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f01f839d729ce231708ccb24489e51f7a6ebb93de3d4eb3f15e62269ed6677e", "ja": "{$P$}、判定を。\nどちらが勝ちましたか？　……ごくり。", "zh": "{$P$}，请判定。究竟是哪边赢了？……咽了口唾沫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d7041930b8029e58c5b8d79669a4119ede8bd22b185029150f159002ffd221ff", "ja": "そうだな……どっちもよかったよ。\n瑞希はもう少し、表情に気を配る余裕が欲しいかな。", "zh": "嗯……两位都表现得很好。\n\n瑞希要是能再多留意一下表情，就更好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a453ae7bd14bbe62e090624f73138ae3dc40dbfc53df76d6fa02d6e76b4c0609", "ja": "麗花は、細かい動きまで意識できると、\nもっと良くなると思う。今のところは、引き分けだな。", "zh": "如果丽花能注意到细微的动作，我觉得会更好。暂时算平局吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "abc549e071ddf270dcf2fc209376c0c58437793aeffc07506c61b620b7959203", "ja": "わーい、ありがとうございます！\n楽しくて、アドバイスまで貰えるなんて、お得ですね♪", "zh": "哇——谢谢你！\n既开心，还能得到建议，真是赚到了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "aa1a481a1ad68fa8c1af19b61663f491bda0f79fd3c2cd68eb617c9c73e45606", "ja": "あ……あの、{$P$}さん！\n次は私のダンスも見てください、お願いしますっ！", "zh": "啊……那个，{$P$}先生！下次也请看看我的舞蹈，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "41db8e47a00ef15f31f0a1f704c5454038caa96ae9ad55398276c1a999d97503", "ja": "{$P$}、\nあたしも見て欲しいべさ～！", "zh": "{$P$}，我也想让你看看呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "8d266de4c16e359d09e185aefeed96f3fb32980ff0eba5f5afff35ace876a2b2", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}さん、大人気ですね♪\n私も後でお願いしますね。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生真受欢迎呢♪\n待会儿也拜托您看看我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "67f6c83d5cf7ef6d9ed86050d57ee8290f2e9262a9491e8f053591541cfecb04", "ja": "（スローガンどおり、凄いモチベーションの高さだ。\nこれは勢いのある公演になりそうだぞ！）", "zh": "（正如口号所说，大家的干劲都非常高涨。看来这会是一场气势十足的公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
